WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Digitizing topographic contours and
extracting precise coordinate points from raster maps.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Validating digitized Collar data and converting both
Collar and Assay datasets into custom binary format (.mm).

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Importing borehole data, merging geological layers,
and selecting target parameters such as thickness and ore grades.

4
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Generating spatial models using Inverse Distance to a Power (IDP)
interpolation algorithm for Z-coordinates and grade distribution.

5
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Visualizing 3D ore body surfaces and integrating borehole
trajectories to validate the geological model geometry.

6
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Calculating recoverable ore volume and estimating
the Stripping Ratio to evaluate economic feasibility.

7
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Finalizing resource estimation using
the Trapezoidal method for accurate mine planning optimization.